  (uuid_generate_v4(), '925-sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-bracelet-stretchy-or-toggle-clasp', '1793082974', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1793082974/925-sterling-silver-navajo-pearl?click_key=4e1e48ef-28ef-46b9-ba4f-86195df14c94%3ALT94d3d5b0420fb535cf876f60c322ac9e52b89168&click_sum=7c3f7b6a&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-455540-20-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&content_source=4e1e48ef-28ef-46b9-ba4f-86195df14c94%253ALT94d3d5b0420fb535cf876f60c322ac9e52b89168',
   '925 Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Bracelet, stretchy or toggle clasp', 'All bracelets are currently sold out and set to pre-order. All pre-orders take 2-6 weeks. All other sizes in stock! Items not in stock take 2-4 weeks to be made to order. Discover the timeless elegance of our 925 Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Bracelet, available in two stunning 7.5" styles: a stretchy version and a clasped version with Navajo pearl beads secured by a toggle clasp. Crafted from high-quality sterling silver, each Navajo pearl bead symbolizes strength, beauty, and the rich cultural heritage of the Navajo people. The stretchy bracelet offers a comfortable and versatile fit, perfect for everyday wear, while the clasp bracelet provides a secure and elegant closure for any occasion. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, this bracelet embodies the spiritual significance and traditional artistry of Navajo jewelry, making it a meaningful accessory that enhances any ensemble with its cultural and aesthetic appeal.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
