   'Handmade Native American Colorful Tribal Crochet Rope Beaded Necklace with matching Hoop earring Minimalist Boho Jewelry', 'Handmade Beaded Necklace: Carefully crafted with tiny seed beads for a unique artisan look. Bright Design: Vibrant orange color with a beautiful multicolor geometric accent pattern. Adjustable Length: Includes a chain extender for a comfortable and flexible fit. Boho & Tribal Style: Perfect for bohemian, ethnic-inspired, minimalist, and everyday jewelry looks. Great Gift Idea: A lovely handmade jewelry gift for birthdays, holidays, anniversaries, or any special occasion. Production partners HandymakeStudio makes this item with help from martin, India', 'turquoise-jewelry',
