   'Bronzite Necklace and Earring Set, Copper Patina Faux Navajo Pearls, Western Jewelry', 'Meet Beartooth, a handmade Western necklace and earring set inspired by the rugged peaks, weathered mountain landscapes, and untamed beauty of the Beartooth Mountains in Montana and Wyoming. Rich, earthy 6mm faceted bronzite beads feature beautiful shades of chocolate brown, bronze, and golden brown, with natural variations that echo the rocky terrain of the American West. Copper-tone faux Navajo pearls with a vibrant turquoise patina add rustic character and striking contrast to this delicate Southwestern design. The combination of dark gemstones and weathered copper creates a versatile Western look that pairs beautifully with denim, leather, boots, and everyday outfits. Matching drop earrings complete the set, giving you a coordinated look that''s equally at home on the ranch or out on the town. Details: • Necklace length: 16" • 3" extender for adjustable fit • 6mm faceted bronzite lentil beads • Copper-tone faux Navajo pearls with turquoise patina • Matching earrings included • Earring drop length: 1.6" Natural bronzite beads feature individual variations in color and pattern, making each handmade set uniquely beautiful. Click here to be taken to our other necklace sets: https://www.etsy.com/shop/CactusAndCoralInc?ref=seller-platform-mcnav&dd_referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.etsy.com%2Fyour%2Fshops%2Fme%2Flisting-editor%2Fcopy%2F1344774936§ion_id=39622868 Join us to be notified of new releases and exclusive discounts! https://linktr.ee/cactusandcoral Thank you for stopping by. Have a blessed day! Sincerely, The Cactus and Coral Crew', 'statement-pieces',
