  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-winston-mason-signed-sterling-silver-turquoise-pendant-necklace-9', '4613398522', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4613398522/vintage-navajo-winston-mason-signed?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT09a41ddaaf2708f53e4323ac60afead752fc9e59&click_sum=b12f7929&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-33&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT09a41ddaaf2708f53e4323ac60afead752fc9e59',
   'Vintage Navajo WINSTON MASON Signed Sterling Silver Turquoise Pendant Necklace 925', 'This striking Southwestern statement piece features a signature geometric pendant designed by renowned Navajo silversmith Winston Mason. The pendant showcases a vibrant, elongated turquoise cabochon securely set in a serrated bezel, framed ay a modernist sterling silver shield with textured and linear accents. The back of the pendant is clearly stamped with the crisp artisan hallmark of Winston Mason. It displays beautifully on its accompanying high quality sterling silver link chain. The total weight of the set is 16.6 grams with the pendant alone at 9 grams. The pendant length is 1.75 inches and width is 1 inch. The turquoise is 23.9 mm in length. The rolo link chain is 20.5 inches in length with a sturdy spring ring clasp. Please note: Measurements are approximate. The set is in good preowned condition with original patina and wear commensurate with age. This wonderful find will be safely packed and mailed to the new owner in a jewelry presentation box free shipping by USPS Ground Advantage fullly insured with tracking number.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
