  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'necklace-trading-post-no-1-vintage-glass-beads-old-chevron-bead-handmade-925-ste', '4613317448', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4613317448/necklace-trading-post-no1-vintage-glass?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT9c8a7665f46c7fbb09d49f51039f62aec099eee8&click_sum=b74f0df3&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-32&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT9c8a7665f46c7fbb09d49f51039f62aec099eee8',
   'Necklace ‚TRADING POST No.1‘, Vintage Glass Beads, Old Chevron Bead, Handmade 925 Sterling Silver Concho, Length 66cm', 'This lovely necklace is made with old Venetian glass beads from the 1920s/1930s. These beads have an amazing bright red colour and a nice patina due to their age. This necklace has a total length of approximately 66cm and is fully knotted (one knot every two beads) with a natural black silk thread. Core element is the handmade 925 sterling silver concho. Another highlight is the blue old „Chevron“ bead and the handmade sterling silver bead on the left side. This unique necklace refers the old american „Trading Posts“, where different goods (jewelry, crafts etc.) were sold and exchanged. Due to the knots and the silk thread, the necklace falls very naturally and smooth. It can be worn by women and men. Please do NOT WEAR during shower, swimming etc.: the water and chemicals can saturate and damage the thread. If you have any questions don’t hesitate to ask me. The measurements are approximately 5mm (red glass beads) and 9,5mm (diameter of concho). IMPORTANT: the silver concho IS FIX in the necklace and cannot be put off! Also check my instagram for more information: hatmaker_jm', 'turquoise-jewelry',
