   'Western Turquoise Bar Necklace and Earrings Set, Navajo Bead Choker, Southwestern Jewelry Set', 'Bring effortless Western style to your collection with this handcrafted-inspired turquoise color natual stone jewelry set. The necklace features a rectangular turquoise stone centerpiece accented with oxidized gray Navajo-style beads, paired with matching drop earrings for a coordinated look. The versatile design works beautifully with denim, boho outfits, Western wear, and everyday fashion. Lightweight and comfortable, it’s perfect for adding a Southwestern touch without feeling heavy. Features • Matching necklace and earrings set • Gray Navajo-style bead necklace • Rectangle Natural stone design • Adjustable extender chain • Lightweight for all-day wear • Western and Southwestern inspired style', 'turquoise-jewelry',
