  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-style-graduated-copper-tone-bead-necklace-matching-earrings-set-20inch-we', '4551359750', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4551359750/graduated-copper-bead-statement-necklace?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT6108549faedc2723d509f0eae90fe3eb1345871d&click_sum=2ac89af0&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-26&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT6108549faedc2723d509f0eae90fe3eb1345871d',
   'Navajo Style Graduated Copper Tone Bead Necklace & Matching Earrings Set, 20inch Western Statement Jewelry', 'This graduated copper-tone bead necklace features oversized beads that gradually transition from 25mm to 20mm and 18mm, creating a beautiful statement look with a Western and Southwestern feel. The rich copper-tone finish pairs beautifully with turquoise jewelry, Western outfits, denim, and neutral colors. Wear it alone as a statement piece or layer it with your favorite Western jewelry. Details: * Necklace Length: Approx. 18 inches * Extension Chain: Approx. 5 inches * Adjustable up to approx. 23 inches * Graduated Bead Sizes: 25mm / 20mm / 18mm * Lobster Claw Closure * Copper-tone finish * Bold graduated bead design * Western / Southwestern inspired style Please note that colors may vary slightly depending on lighting and screen settings.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
