   'White Stone Squash Blossom Necklace, Western Statement Necklace, Navajo Style Beaded', 'Make a bold Western statement with this beautiful white stone squash blossom style necklace. Featuring creamy white natural stones with unique brown veining, ornate silver-tone details, and dark Navajo-style beads, this necklace has a striking vintage Southwestern look. The large teardrop pendant creates a dramatic focal point, while the coordinating oval stones along both sides give the necklace a beautiful balanced design. Details: * Natural white stone * Silver-tone Navajo-style beads and metalwork * Southwestern / Western inspired design * Total necklace length: approximately 28 inches * Toggle section: approximately 3 inches * Large pendant: approximately 2.5 inches wide × 3 inches tall * Each natural stone may vary slightly in color, pattern, and veining * Statement size and substantial design * Perfect for Western, Southwestern, cowgirl, rodeo, ranch, and boho styling Please note: This piece is Southwestern/Navajo-style jewelry and is not Native American-made. The stones are natural stone and are not genuine turquoise.', 'statement-pieces',
