   'Kingman Turquoise Cuff Bangle 925 Sterling Silver, Genuine Southwestern Turquoise Bangle, Vintage Western Boho Oval Gemstone Bangle Gift Her', 'Kingman Turquoise Cuff Bangle 925 Sterling Silver, Genuine Southwestern Turquoise Bangle, Vintage Western Boho Oval Gemstone Bangle Gift Her ✨ Handcrafted Genuine Kingman Turquoise Cuff Bracelet in 925 Sterling Silver Body Content: Add a touch of authentic Western elegance to your jewelry collection with this stunning Kingman Turquoise Cuff Bracelet. Featuring a vibrant oval Kingman turquoise cabochon set in fine sterling silver, this bangle showcases delicate rope wire trim and classic shell design motifs, giving it a timeless Southwestern aesthetic. Crafted in high-quality 925 Sterling Silver with a comfortable split-shank band, this piece is lightweight enough for everyday wear while making a beautiful vintage-inspired statement. 🌟 Key Features: Gemstone: 100% Genuine Kingman Turquoise (Oval Cabochon with natural matrix). Metal: Solid 925 Sterling Silver (Stamped 925). Design: Southwestern Rope & Shell Detailing with a Split Band. Style: Western, Boho, Southwestern, Vintage Statement. Fit: Adjustable open cuff (easily adjusts to fit most wrist sizes). 🎁 Perfect Gift For: Birthdays, Anniversaries, Mother''s Day, Christmas, or Western & Boho style lovers. Ideal for layering with other silver bangles or wearing solo as an elegant accent.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
