  (uuid_generate_v4(), '5mm-navajo-style-pearls-hand-finished-german-silver-beads', '4373727003', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4373727003/5mm-navajo-pearls-handmade-from-german?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT2b83d6f4df35f15a0e86809cd52880596eda082e&click_sum=2475f9ad&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-14&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pop=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT2b83d6f4df35f15a0e86809cd52880596eda082e',
   '5mm Navajo Style Pearls ~ Hand-finished German silver beads', 'Loose Hand-finished Navajo Style Pearls Made In German Silver for Jewelry Making, Beading, Wirework Bead Size: 5mm in diameter, hole: 1.8mm. These Navajo Style Pearls are made of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Although not sterling silver, German silver has the same lifelong quality, look, and weight of solid sterling Navajo pearls at 1/3 the price! German silver is a durable, beautiful metal and does contain trace amounts of nickel. These beautiful hand-finished western pearls should be a staple in every jewelry designer''s inventory. They are exceptional design elements for all Southwestern style Jewelry!', 'accessories',
