   'Navajo Pearl Handmade Three Strand Leather Adjustable Turquoise Necklace ~ German Silver beads!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! Stunning Western Navajo Pearl & Turquoise Necklace. Made from 5, 6 and 10mm beads. This adjustable design is strung on high-quality leather. The Sterling Silver slider bead allows for fully custom sizing- fits any neck size! Genuine leather is about 36” long. DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two desert pearls are exactly alike! See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
